@Host = http://localhost:5200

### 1. Seed Module 10 Sales Data (Buyers, Sales, SalesItems, SalesPayments)
POST {{Host}}/api/Sales/seed
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Paginated Sales List (with search, buyer, crop, farm, status, date filters)
GET {{Host}}/api/Sales?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=DateDesc
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Sales KPI Summary
GET {{Host}}/api/Sales/summary
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Sales Analytics (by Crop, Buyer, Farm, Monthly Trend)
GET {{Host}}/api/Sales/analytics
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create Sale (auto-calculates Gross & Net + auto-creates SalesItem)
POST {{Host}}/api/Sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "salesDate": "2026-11-20",
  "buyer": "Sri Lakshmi Traders",
  "farm": "Sunrise Valley Farm",
  "crop": "Cotton",
  "quantity": 50,
  "unit": "Quintals",
  "rate": 7200,
  "commission": 3600,
  "transport": 2400,
  "paymentStatus": "Pending",
  "remarks": "First picking cotton lot"
}

### 6. Create Multi-Item Sale with Initial Payment
POST {{Host}}/api/Sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "salesDate": "2026-11-20",
  "buyer": "Hyderabad Wholesale Mandi",
  "farm": "Green Hills Orchard",
  "commission": 1500,
  "transport": 1000,
  "initialPaymentAmount": 50000,
  "paymentMode": "UPI",
  "referenceNo": "UPI-2026-99102",
  "items": [
    { "crop": "Organic Tomatoes", "quantity": 1000, "unit": "kg", "rate": 35 },
    { "crop": "Chilli", "quantity": 5, "unit": "Quintals", "rate": 16000 }
  ]
}

### 7. Get Sale By ID (includes Items & Payments)
GET {{Host}}/api/Sales/1
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Line Items for Sale ID 1
GET {{Host}}/api/Sales/1/items
Accept: application/json

### 9. Export Sales as CSV
GET {{Host}}/api/Sales/export
Accept: text/csv

### 10. Get Buyers List (with computed sales & outstanding balance)
GET {{Host}}/api/Buyers
Accept: application/json

### 11. Get Buyers Summary KPIs
GET {{Host}}/api/Buyers/summary
Accept: application/json

### 12. Get Buyer Financial Ledger (Profile + Sales + Payments)
GET {{Host}}/api/Buyers/1/ledger
Accept: application/json

### 13. Create Buyer
POST {{Host}}/api/Buyers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerName": "Godavari Agro Exports",
  "mobile": "9849556677",
  "address": "Rajahmundry Market Yard, Andhra Pradesh",
  "businessName": "Godavari Agro Exports Pvt Ltd",
  "gstin": "37AABCG1234K1Z1",
  "openingBalance": 10000,
  "status": "Active"
}

### 14. Get Sales Receivables Overview
GET {{Host}}/api/Sales/receivables
Accept: application/json

### 15. Get All Sales Payments
GET {{Host}}/api/SalesPayments
Accept: application/json

### 16. Get Sales Payments Summary (breakdown by payment mode)
GET {{Host}}/api/SalesPayments/summary
Accept: application/json

### 17. Record a Sales Payment (auto-updates parent Sale PaymentStatus)
POST {{Host}}/api/SalesPayments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "salesNo": "SAL-2026-003",
  "paymentDate": "2026-11-20",
  "paymentAmount": 66500,
  "paymentMode": "Bank",
  "referenceNo": "NEFT-SBI-990182",
  "remarks": "Part payment received for Maize sale"
}
